    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "warning_body",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 462,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "None of these callers received ConfigRegistry via their constructor -- they reached\nout and grabbed it. That dependency is invisible in a constructor signature and\ninvisible to a unit test trying to substitute a fake.",
